---
export const title = 'Events';
export const order = 300;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---
<p>
  Toggling the switch fires a <code>change</code> CustomEvent; <code>event.detail.checked</code> holds the
  new state. Inside a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>, a checked switch submits <code>on</code> under its
  <code>name</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
    <wc-switch id='change-toggle-field'>Change Event?</wc-switch>
    <script is:inline>
      document.querySelector('#change-toggle-field').addEventListener('change', function(event) {
        myConsole.log('Switch changed to :: ' + event.detail.checked);
      });
    </script>
</DemoComponentCard>
